+### `land-pr` is status-only unless critical
+
+Landing convergence belongs to the configured queue and controller paths, not
+to an author-agent watch loop. `caco agent land-pr --id <agent>` therefore does
+one `gh pr view`, reports the PR state plus a no-babysit advisory, and returns;
+it does not sleep, update the branch, or fall back. The historical bounded
+client-side update/CI/fallback loop is available only with explicit
